05) 456-9336","linkedin":"","instagram":"","facebook":"","services":"Laser hair removal; laser skin rejuvenation; laser treatment for veins; laser treatment for rosacea; laser for pigmentation & sun spots; laser cherry angioma removal; laser nail fungus removal; cellulite & body contouring treatments; EMS muscle building & sculpting; Fibroblast plasma skin tightening; microneedling (PRP or basic); facials & all skin care treatments; injectables/dermal injectables; Kybella; miraDry; ThermiVA; intimate whitening/bleaching; body waxing; post-surgical lymphatic drainage; eyelash extensions","existingEquipment":"Laser hair removal platform; body contouring device(s) for cellulite/shape treatments; EMS muscle-stimulation sculpting system; Fibroblast plasma device; microneedling/PRP setup; miraDry device; ThermiVa radiofrequency system; vascular/vein laser; skin rejuvenation laser; nail fungus laser","expansionSignals":"15+ years in business; 4.8 rating with 156 reviews; multiple advanced aesthetic modalities already marketed; emphasizes customized plans and minimally invasive treatments; active service menu suggests ongoing investment in energy-based aesthetics","leadScore":"84","buyerFit":"Strong fit for premium aesthetic laser and body-contouring equipment. They already sell multiple device-driven services, which usually indicates comfort with capital equipment, patient education, and treatment-package economics.","scoreReasoning":"This med spa is clearly laser- and device-heavy, with services spanning hair removal, vascular/pigmentation, rejuvenation, body contouring, EMS sculpting, plasma tightening, miraDry, and ThermiVa. That breadth suggests they are likely to evaluate replacement, expansion, or complementary equipment. The only uncertainty is current ownership of specific devices versus outsourced/partnered services, but the website strongly indicates an established in-house treatment menu.","salesAngle":"Position new equipment as a way to expand their already broad premium menu, increase package sales, and add complementary revenue without overpromising results. Focus on faster treatment times, differentiation in Brickell/Miami, and adding one more high-demand modality to their existing laser portfolio.","angleEvidence":"Their site repeatedly emphasizes customized treatments, advanced techniques, minimally invasive aesthetics, and multiple device-based services including laser hair removal, body contouring, EMS sculpting, microneedling/PRP, miraDry, ThermiVa, and vascular/pigmentation lasers.","bestChannel":"Phone call followed by email/website form; if available, a direct local visit works well for med spa equipment sales.","openingAngle":"Open with a compliment on their unusually broad energy-based service menu, then ask whether they are adding capacity, replacing aging platforms, or looking for a complementary device to increase package revenue.","personalization":"Reference their Miami/Brickell location and the fact that they already market several premium device treatments for skin, body, and wellness. That makes them a likely candidate for another revenue-generating platform rather than a basic starter machine.","suggestedMessage":"Hi Caruna team — I took a look at your service menu and was impressed by how many device-based treatments you already offer, from laser hair removal and vein/pigmentation work to EMS sculpting, miraDry, and ThermiVa. If you’re ever evaluating an additional platform to expand treatment capacity or add a complementary high-demand service, I’d love to share a few options that fit an established med spa like yours. Would it make sense to compare what you’re using today versus what you’d like to add next?","sources":"https://www.allbiz.com/business/caruna-med-spa-laser-center-305-456-9336https://carunamedspa.com/https://carunamedspa.com/services/https://carunamedspa.com/services/cellulite-body-toning-contouring/https://carunamedspa.com/services/laser-hair-removal/https://carunamedspa.com/services/ems-muscle-building-sculpting/https://carunamedspa.com/services/fibroblast-plasma-skin-tightening/https://carunamedspa.com/services/miradry/https://carunamedspa.com/services/thermiva/https://carunamedspa.com/services/laser-treatment-for-veins/https://www.carunamedspa.com/","enrichedAt":"2026-08-25T20:23:55.192Z","needsHumanReview":"TRUE","stage":"Researching","owner":"","nextAction":"","nextActionDate":"","lastContacted":"","callAttempts":"0","callOutcome":"","notes":"","searchTerm":"med spa","searchCity":"Miami FL","scrapedAt":"2026-08-25T04:47:42.979Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-25T20:23:59.987Z"}');
