ser hair removal, plasma pen, microneedling, and skin tightening. A 5+ year practice with strong reviews and a physician founder increases buying credibility. Fit is not perfect only because the crawl does not confirm current laser brand counts or immediate purchase timing.","salesAngle":"Position a complementary or upgrade path around their current Morpheus8/IPL/laser hair removal menu: more treatment versatility, better throughput, and the ability to add higher-margin resurfacing or body/skin tightening services without relying on outsourced referrals.","angleEvidence":"Website explicitly lists Morpheus8 Face, Eyes & Neck; Morpheus8 Body; IPL Skin Spots Remover; Laser Hair Removal; Plexr Plasma Pen; Skin Tightening; Body Contouring; laser treatments; and radiofrequency microneedling—clear signals of an energy-device-forward practice.","bestChannel":"email","openingAngle":"You already market Morpheus8, IPL, laser hair removal, and skin tightening at Monaco MedSpa, so I thought of you for an equipment conversation focused on expanding those same high-demand services with more capacity and versatility.","personalization":"Reference Dr. Jeannette Barrueta as founder/MD and the practice’s natural-results, physician-led positioning; tie outreach to their Midtown Miami location and current menu of Morpheus8, IPL, laser hair removal, and body contouring.","suggestedMessage":"Hi Dr. Barrueta — I noticed Monaco MedSpa already offers Morpheus8 Face/Body, IPL skin spots removal, laser hair removal, Plexr, and skin tightening. Since your practice is clearly built around energy-based aesthetics and natural-looking results, I wanted to reach out about options that could expand treatment capacity or add another high-margin service line without disrupting your current menu. If helpful, I can share a few equipment paths that fit a physician-led med spa like yours in Midtown Miami.","sources":"https://www.monacomedspa.com/dr-jeannette-barrueta-miami-flhttps://search.sunbiz.org/Inqui