ces in a premium Design District setting.","angleEvidence":"The site prominently lists Morpheus8, EvolveX, Venus Versa, CO2 laser, Sofwave, Lumecca IPL, HydraFacial, laser hair removal, SkinPen, and memberships that include device-based services such as EvolveX, Venus body contouring, vein removal, red light therapy, and pressotherapy. That points to a practice that sells recurring aesthetic treatments and already understands device-driven revenue.","bestChannel":"Phone, then follow-up email","openingAngle":"Lead with a short note to Ava Franzoni about how Aviva already has a strong device mix and memberships, then suggest a complementary technology that can create a new signature treatment or improve utilization of their existing patient base.","personalization":"Reference their Miami Design District positioning, the mix of Morpheus8/EvolveX/Venus Versa/Sofwave/CO2 laser, and their membership model. Ava Franzoni is the founder, so a founder-to-founder style message about growth, patient retention, and premium service differentiation should resonate.","suggestedMessage":"Hi Ava — I took a look at Aviva Medical Spa and saw how strong your device lineup already is, especially Morpheus8, EvolveX, Venus Versa, Sofwave, CO2 laser, and Lumecca/IPL. Since you’re clearly building around premium, recurring treatments and memberships, I thought it might be worth sharing one complementary device option that could help you add a new signature service or increase utilization across your existing patient base. If helpful, I can send a quick comparison built around ROI, treatment demand, and how it could fit a Miami Design District med spa like yours.","sources":"https://avivamedicalspa.com/our-team/https://avivamedicalspa.com/https://avivamedicalspa.com/contact-us/https://avivamedicalspa.com/home/https://avivamedicalspa.com/about-us/https://avivamedicalspa.com/memberships/https://avivamedicalspa.com/facials-miami/https://avivamedicalspa.com/massage-therapy-services/https://avivam