ities this year.","personalization":"Reference their Brickell location, premium medspa positioning, and the fact that they already market both face and body treatments, especially laser hair removal and body sculpting. ([fbconceptmedspa.com](https://www.fbconceptmedspa.com/?utm_source=openai))","suggestedMessage":"Hi Face & Body Concept team — I saw your Brickell medspa offers laser hair removal, IPL photofacials, microneedling/PRP, and body sculpting, alongside memberships. If you’re looking at ways to increase treatment capacity or add a higher-utilization device, I’d love to share a quick comparison based on your current service mix. Open to a 10-minute call?","sources":"https://www.fbconceptmedspa.com/https://www.fbconceptmedspa.com/contacthttps://www.fbconceptmedspa.com/serviceshttps://www.fbconceptmedspa.com/membershipshttps://www.fbconceptmedspa.com/laser-hair-removalhttps://www.fbconceptmedspa.com/body-sculptinghttps://www.fbconceptmedspa.com/microneedlinghttps://www.fbconceptmedspa.com/ipl-photofacial","enrichedAt":"2026-08-25T18:56:47.925Z","needsHumanReview":"TRUE","stage":"Researching","owner":"","nextAction":"","nextActionDate":"","lastContacted":"","callAttempts":"0","callOutcome":"","notes":"","searchTerm":"med spa","searchCity":"Miami FL","scrapedAt":"2026-08-25T04:47:42.980Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-25T18:56:53.071Z"}');
