 Fractional Laser; Hollywood Peeling; Salmon DNA (PDRN); Skin Pen Microneedling; Body Sculpt; Fat Burner; Hair Scalpt Exosome; Laser Hair Removal; Pink Intimate Whitening; IV Therapy; NAD+; Weight Loss Treatment","existingEquipment":"CO2 fractional laser; laser hair removal device; microneedling device (SkinPen); Hydradermabrasion/Hydrafacial system","expansionSignals":"Multiple higher-ticket aesthetic services already offered, especially CO2 Fractional Laser and Laser Hair Removal; broad menu across facial, anti-aging, body, and wellness categories; active payment plans and bundle promotions suggest appetite for upsell/add-on treatments; 5+ years in business with 318 reviews indicates stable operations and potential capacity to add equipment","leadScore":"84","buyerFit":"Strong fit for aesthetic laser equipment. This is a multi-service medspa already offering laser-based and advanced skin treatments, so they likely understand device ROI and patient demand. Miami Brickell location and strong review volume suggest enough traffic to support premium equipment upgrades or additional platforms.","scoreReasoning":"They already list CO2 Fractional Laser and Laser Hair Removal, which are direct indicators of existing laser adoption and familiarity with device-driven services. The spa also markets anti-aging and body services, which can support expansion into complementary energy-based treatments. Stable reputation and multi-year operation increase likelihood of budget and buying intent.","salesAngle":"Position an upgrade or complementary device that increases treatment breadth, improves results for acne/scarring/anti-aging, and creates new package revenue without disrupting their current facial-led brand.","angleEvidence":"Website emphasizes advanced aesthetic technology, before-and-after results, anti-aging, personalized medical aesthetics, and bundle promotions; current menu already includes CO2 Fractional Laser and Laser Hair Removal, showing openness to premium device-based offerings.","bestChannel":"Phone call followed by email","openingAngle":"Reach out to Claudia Roeder with a short ROI-focused note: since Asha already offers CO2 fractional laser and laser hair removal, you can show how an additional platform or higher-output system could expand anti-aging, acne-scar, and resurfacing packages for Brickell patients.","personalization":"Reference Asha’s Brickell medspa positioning, their advanced technology messaging, and Claudia’s anti-aging focus. Mention that their current menu already spans facial rejuvenation, laser, and body/wellness—ideal for adding a device that increases package value and repeat visits.","suggestedMessage":"Hi Claudia — I noticed Asha already offers CO2 Fractional Laser, laser hair removal, and a strong anti-aging menu in Brickell. Since you’re clearly building around advanced results and package promotions, I thought it may be worth sharing a device option that could help you expand resurfacing and rejuvenation offerings while increasing treatment-ticket value. If you’re open, I can send a quick comparison tailored to your current menu.","sources":"https://search.sunbiz.org/Inquiry/corporationsearch/SearchResultDetail?aggregateId=flal-l20000020103-e3b135ca-d501-41fe-85d2-9444871a3a27&directionType=Initial&inquirytype=EntityName&listNameOrder=ASHADTRUCKING+L220002356420&searchNameOrder=ASHAESTHETIC+L200000201030&searchTerm=ASHAD+TRUCKING+LLChttps://www.ashaesthetics.com/https://www.ashaesthetics.com/meet-the-teamhttps://www.ashaesthetics.com/contact-ushttps://www.ashaesthetics.com/privacy-policy","enrichedAt":"2026-09-07T00:48:40.933Z","needsHumanReview":"TRUE","stage":"Researching","owner":"","nextAction":"","nextActionDate":"","lastContacted":"","callAttempts":"0","callOutcome":"","notes":"","searchTerm":"med spa","searchCity":"Miami FL","scrapedAt":"2026-08-25T04:47:42.980Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-07T00:48:45.234Z"}');
